---Parameters to be applied to the cluster-autoscaler when auto scaling is enabled for the provisioned cluster.
---@class azure.hybridaks.ProvisionedClusterPropertiesAutoScalerProfile
---@field balance_similar_node_groups? string Valid values are 'true' and 'false'
---@field expander? azure.hybridaks.ProvisionedClusterPropertiesAutoScalerProfileExpander If not specified, the default is 'random'. See [expanders](https://github.com/kubernetes/autoscaler/blob/master/cluster-autoscaler/FAQ.md#what-are-expanders) for more information.
---@field max_empty_bulk_delete? string The default is 10.
---@field max_graceful_termination_sec? string The default is 600.
---@field max_node_provision_time? string The default is '15m'. Values must be an integer followed by an 'm'. No unit of time other than minutes (m) is supported.
---@field max_total_unready_percentage? string The default is 45. The maximum is 100 and the minimum is 0.
---@field new_pod_scale_up_delay? string For scenarios like burst/batch scale where you don't want CA to act before the kubernetes scheduler could schedule all the pods, you can tell CA to ignore unscheduled pods before they're a certain age. The default is '0s'. Values must be an integer followed by a unit ('s' for seconds, 'm' for minutes, 'h' for hours, etc).
---@field ok_total_unready_count? string This must be an integer. The default is 3.
---@field scan_interval? string The default is '10'. Values must be an integer number of seconds.
---@field scale_down_delay_after_add? string The default is '10m'. Values must be an integer followed by an 'm'. No unit of time other than minutes (m) is supported.
---@field scale_down_delay_after_delete? string The default is the scan-interval. Values must be an integer followed by an 'm'. No unit of time other than minutes (m) is supported.
---@field scale_down_delay_after_failure? string The default is '3m'. Values must be an integer followed by an 'm'. No unit of time other than minutes (m) is supported.
---@field scale_down_unneeded_time? string The default is '10m'. Values must be an integer followed by an 'm'. No unit of time other than minutes (m) is supported.
---@field scale_down_unready_time? string The default is '20m'. Values must be an integer followed by an 'm'. No unit of time other than minutes (m) is supported.
---@field scale_down_utilization_threshold? string The default is '0.5'.
---@field skip_nodes_with_local_storage? string The default is true.
---@field skip_nodes_with_system_pods? string The default is true.

---If not specified, the default is 'random'. See [expanders](https://github.com/kubernetes/autoscaler/blob/master/cluster-autoscaler/FAQ.md#what-are-expanders) for more information.
---@alias azure.hybridaks.ProvisionedClusterPropertiesAutoScalerProfileExpander "least-waste"|"most-pods"|"priority"|"random"

